From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:20:27 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Block form: Preview modal showing the .conf that Save would
 write

The Preview button opens a modal that POSTs the form's current values
to a new /block-preview endpoint. It renders them with the same
build_block_from_form() call Save uses (nothing is written) and returns
the content plus the file name it would be saved as, or the same
validation error Save would show.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
